msgid "You can now switch between workspaces by clicking your workspace name at the top left of the screen. This feature will only appear if you have been invited to join another workspace."
msgstr "You can now switch between workspaces by clicking your workspace name at the top left of the screen. This feature will only appear if you have been invited to join another workspace."

#. js-lingui-id: eheMXY
